{"skill":{"slug":"ai-picture-book","displayName":"Baidu Wenku AI picture book of video"},"version":{"version":"1.1.2","createdAt":1777368716946,"changelog":"- Updated all English documentation and descriptions to Chinese, adapting for a Chinese-speaking audience.\n- Expanded application scenarios section, listing more detailed and specific use cases.\n- Clarified workflow and instructions, keeping structure similar but with revised and more localized examples and explanations.\n- Maintained core API usage and error messages, but presented with localized formatting and phrasing.\n- No code changes or structural modifications detected.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"_meta.json","size":134,"sha256":"083ceb54862bec1c5429d26b2cf4f802902eb234a5b67b850d7196177ffa243d","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"scripts/ai_picture_book_task_query.py","size":2690,"sha256":"980eb98724e4ffcbc35b41ef9b599c705877e43b0296571c07d1a72797117cf9","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"scripts/ai_picture_book_poll.py","size":4845,"sha256":"4fb64116194eca4d842a2cca6e72c980efcb1e49fa50928762b8659b42cfcb44","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"scripts/ai_picture_book_task_create.py","size":2623,"sha256":"2590d34490615891ee20067b9c50dc798d831e8bb712cc0899558589fa0c581a","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3177,"sha256":"465673bfd02ea7b7710b2ce8a84ad9288a93d9f0b2d16b616b9ab77623d99532","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2190,"sha256":"470f7ebef7392573fcb361639dd378bdbc73aa2a274ac284357e0de2958b457e","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789034863147,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"6281792c1192427f4a94e4a2eef56cfee133331fc6765de910307e2bb6a0c12e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/6281792c1192427f4a94e4a2eef56cfee133331fc6765de910307e2bb6a0c12e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: ai-picture-book\nVersion: 1.1.2\n\nThe skill bundle provides a legitimate interface for the Baidu Wenku AI Picture Book service, allowing users to generate AI-driven stories. The included Python scripts (ai_picture_book_task_create.py, ai_picture_book_task_query.py, and ai_picture_book_poll.py) interact with the official Baidu Qianfan API (qianfan.baidubce.com) using standard requests. The code includes platform-specific logic for sandbox environments but shows no signs of malicious intent, data exfiltration, or unauthorized execution.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779161553981},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":43,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":6,"checkedAt":1789034863147},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill’s core picture-book function is legitimate, but it contains an undocumented proxy mode that can redirect submitted story content and task IDs to an arbitrary environment-provided URL.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access and a Baidu API key are proportionate for this integration, but accepting DUMATE_SCHEDULER_URL without scheme or host validation is overbroad because it can send content, task IDs, and a session identifier to an untrusted or non-HTTPS destination.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"No installer, package manager action, remote payload retrieval, or startup hook was found; the skill consists of documentation plus local Python scripts requiring python3 and BAIDU_API_KEY.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"SKILL.md documents Baidu endpoints, BAIDU_API_KEY, task creation, query, and polling, but does not describe the proxy path, the session identifier header, arbitrary scheduler destination behavior, or privacy implications for submitted story content.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The inspected artifacts do not write files, install persistence, modify tools, request elevated privileges, or execute downloaded code.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Creating and querying Baidu AI picture-book tasks matches the stated purpose, and sending story text to a cloud API is expected; however, the scripts can silently replace the Baidu endpoint with DUMATE_SCHEDULER_URL and include DUMATE_SESSION_ID, which is not disclosed in the skill instructions.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Review before installing. Use only in a trusted environment, avoid submitting confidential or regulated story content, prefer BAIDU_API_KEY from the environment instead of command-line arguments, and do not run it with DUMATE_SCHEDULER_URL or DUMATE_SESSION_ID set unless you trust that exact scheduler service.","findings":"[LP3] unexpected: The general concern about missing least-privilege declarations is supported by the undocumented proxy environment variables, though normal Baidu API access itself is purpose-aligned.\n[SQP-2] expected: Submitting story content to an external Baidu service is inherent to the skill, but the documentation should more plainly warn users that their content leaves the local environment.\n[E1] expected: The direct requests.post calls to Baidu are expected for task creation, query, and polling; the same call sites become concerning because resolve_sandbox_url can redirect them to an arbitrary scheduler URL.\n[SQP-3] expected: Chinese-only interface text is consistent with the Baidu Wenku-focused skill and is a usability/localization note rather than a security concern.\n[T09] unexpected: The static finding is supported: all three scripts use an unvalidated DUMATE_SCHEDULER_URL proxy path that can expose story content or task IDs plus DUMATE_SESSION_ID and accept forged responses.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789034863147}}}}}